## Proposed Changes

### 1. Flask Backend — Chatbot Module

#### [MODIFY] [chatbot.py](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/Documents/WebD/HackathonProject/healthtwin/flask_app/chatbot.py)
- Add a `load_rag_chain()` cached function that loads the FAISS vectorstore and builds a LangChain RAG chain (no `hub.pull`, use inline `PromptTemplate`)
- Add mental health detection: scan user message for distress signals; if detected, prepend a supportive header and route to a mental-health-specific prompt
- Return structured JSON: `{ response, mental_health_alert, sources }`

#### [NEW] `flask_app/rag_chatbot.py`
- Standalone module: `get_rag_chain()` — loads FAISS, creates Groq LLM, builds RAG chain with a custom medical prompt template (avoiding `hub.pull`)
- `detect_mental_health(message)` — keyword + sentiment heuristic returning a dict `{ detected: bool, category: str, severity: low/medium/high }`

